gxtk7 (0.1.1-3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Menu: keep working on Qt 6.8.  QtQuick.Effects's RectangularShadow only
    exists since Qt 6.9, so Menu.qml made the whole Menu type unavailable on
    older Qt ("RectangularShadow is not a type").  CMake now compiles an
    internal drop-in type of the same name when Qt < 6.9; Qt 6.9+ builds are
    unchanged.
  * Depend on qml6-module-qtquick-effects, which Menu.qml imports.

 -- shenmo <shenmo@spark-app.store>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:30:00 +0800

